sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Gateway as vllm-orchestrator-gateway<br/>8090/TCP HTTP
    participant Orchestrator as vLLM Orchestrator<br/>configurable/TCP<br/>HTTP or HTTPS (mTLS)

    Note over Gateway: Startup: loads config.yaml<br/>Builds dynamic routes per config<br/>Optionally loads mTLS certs

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note right of Client: Non-Streaming Flow
        Client->>Gateway: POST /{route_name}/v1/chat/completions<br/>Content-Type: application/json<br/>Authorization: Bearer ... (optional)<br/>Body: OpenAI-compatible chat request
        Gateway->>Gateway: Lookup route config<br/>Inject detectors field<br/>(input/output detector maps)
        Gateway->>Orchestrator: POST /api/v2/chat/completions-detection<br/>Authorization: forwarded<br/>x-forwarded-*: forwarded<br/>Body: enriched request with detectors
        Orchestrator-->>Gateway: JSON response<br/>(with optional detection results)
        Gateway->>Gateway: Check for detections<br/>If detected + fallback configured:<br/>replace model output with fallback
        Gateway-->>Client: JSON response<br/>(original or fallback)
    end

    rect rgb(255, 248, 240)
        Note right of Client: Streaming (SSE) Flow
        Client->>Gateway: POST /{route_name}/v1/chat/completions<br/>stream: true<br/>Authorization: Bearer ... (optional)
        Gateway->>Gateway: Lookup route config<br/>Inject detectors field
        Gateway->>Orchestrator: POST /api/v2/chat/completions-detection<br/>stream: true<br/>Authorization: forwarded
        loop SSE Events
            Orchestrator-->>Gateway: data: {chunk}
            Gateway->>Gateway: Check chunk for detections
            alt Detection found + fallback configured
                Gateway-->>Client: data: {fallback message}
            else No detection
                Gateway-->>Client: data: {chunk} (forwarded)
            end
        end
        Orchestrator-->>Gateway: data: [DONE]
        Gateway-->>Client: data: [DONE]
    end
